      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "How to play?\n\nSpell Brawl is a platform fighting game where you have
    to defeat your opponent in a best-of-three series. If you fall into the void
    once, you lose a life if you lose three lives, you lose the round. \n\nKnock
    your opponent off the platforms in melee combat, using powerful cards to help
    you achieve this. \n\nTry to take as little damage as possible; the more damage
    you take, the higher the chances of being knocked off the platforms."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
